# MegaFon — AdBlock: analytics hosts (loaded when the module's analytics setting is true).
# Policy (REJECT) comes from the RULE-SET line in Megafon/megafon.sgmodule.
# Yandex Metrica in the web app, incl. numbered counter subdomains and Webvisor/clickmap
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mc.yandex.ru
# Varioqub A/B script loaded by Metrica
DOMAIN,abt.s3.yandex.net
# MyTracker SDK in the native shell (also ts. and ip4. subdomains)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tracker-api.vk-analytics.ru
# First-party Elastic APM RUM telemetry (settings.json "track" is also switched off by the script)
URL-REGEX,^https:\/\/lk\.megafon\.ru\/track\/intake\/
